flowchart TD
  A[Home key] --> B[TabletKeyPolicyManager / KeyInterceptorCallback]
  B --> C[KeyPolicyManagerCommon.launchHomeFromHotKey]
  C --> D[Implicit MAIN + CATEGORY_HOME\nflags 0x10200000]
  D --> E[Context.startActivityAsUser\nUserHandle.CURRENT]
  E --> F[Android HOME resolver]
  F --> G[Fire Launcher\npriority 50 in live baseline]

  B --> H[HomeEventHandler.handleCustomHome]
  H --> I[check RECEIVE_CUSTOM_HOME]
  I --> J[Explicit CUSTOM_HOME broadcast\nforeground package receiver]

  K[LauncherHijackPreventer callback] --> L[canSeeHomeTask]
  L --> M[SELinux check\namazon_policies / see_home_task]
  M --> N[Android signature fallback]
  N --> O[Home task visibility allow/deny]

  P[fosinit] --> Q[Amazon private services]
  Q --> R[service_manager lookup by shell UID 2000]
  R --> S{SELinux enforcing}
  S -->|denied| T[No shell Binder handle]
  Q --> U[fosdebug inventory]
  U --> V[Read-only diagnostics;\nnot proof of HOME setter]

  W[Official OTA staging] --> X[verification / metadata / device checks]
  X --> Y[UpdateSystem.install boundary]
  Y --> Z[Natural post-system-OTA lifecycle]
  Z --> AA[BootAfterSystemOTAReceiver]
  AA --> AB[OOBE/setup state branch]
  AB --> AC[Not ordinary preferred HOME selector]

